{"sections":[{"slug":"λ-环","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"λ-环"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“λ-<span lang=\"zh\">环</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“λ-环”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>λ-rings are one incarnation of the representation theory of the symmetric groups</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>λ-rings are all about getting the most for your money when you <strong>decategorify</strong> a <strong>symmetric monoidal abelian category</strong> — for example the category of representations of a group, or the category of vector bundles on a topological space.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>λ-<span lang=\"zh\">环到环的遗忘</span>\n$$\r\nU \\colon \\Lambda\\mathsf {Ring} \\to \\mathsf {Ring}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">有左右伴随</span> $\\operatorname{Symm}\\dashv U\\dashv W$, <span lang=\"zh\">也即自由和余自由</span> λ-<span lang=\"zh\">环</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\operatorname{Symm}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">对称函数</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其元素直观上是无穷多变量的无穷多项式</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在变量的任何排列下不变</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拓扑K-理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span> K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":" $K(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span> λ-<span lang=\"zh\">环结构</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}